OL,3,GNEWSAMan fighting for custody of badger
OL,4,Ahe nursed back from starvation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ecologist in the Scottish Borders is
OL,7,Ffighting to be allowed to keep a badger
OL,8,Fthat he saved from starvation.
OL,10,FGraeme Wilson was called out to help
OL,11,Fthe cub, called Harriet, in April after
OL,12,Fshe was found in a cattle trough 100m
OL,13,F(300ft) from her sett.
OL,15,FWilson nursed the badger back to health
OL,16,Fbut believes she was hand-reared prior
OL,17,Fto this, and it would be impossible to
OL,18,Freturn her to the wild.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
