OL,3,GNEWSAMan fighting for custody of badger
OL,4,Ahe nursed back from starvation
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatureScot - which turned down his
OL,7,Fapplication for an educational licence
OL,8,Fto keep the animal - said it was
OL,9,Fcontinuing talks to try to find a
OL,10,F"pragmatic solution".
